Package: CellOnTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Cell Ontology Mapping, Hierarchy, Similarity, and Marker Enrichment
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-19
Authors@R: person(given = "Di",
                  family = "Wang",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "wangdi0001@foxmail.com")
Description: Provides utilities for loading and querying the Cell Ontology (CL),
    mapping cell-type labels to CL identifiers, converting between labels and
    identifiers, extracting hierarchy subgraphs, computing ontology-based term
    similarity, rolling terms up to coarser resolutions, and performing
    marker-gene over-representation analyses with bundled healthy human and
    mouse CellMarkerAccordion marker annotations.
License: GPL-3
